title: Electoral List Preparations
subtitle: The Acerbo Law looms above the upcoming election.
new-page: true 
tags: event
view-if: pnf_in_power and acerbo_law_passed and (year = next_election_year and month >= next_election_month - 1) and (pnf_leader = "Mussolini" or pnf_leader = "Balbo")
max-visits: 1
go-to: list_menu

= Electoral List Preparations

Following the passing of the Acerbo Law, it seems all but certain that the <span style="font-weight: bold; color:#3D3D3D;">PNF</span> will secure a majority in the Chamber of Deputies and consolidate a one-party dictatorship. However, we should not give up just yet. Though at a disadvantage, we can establish a united Anti-Fascist List against the <span style="font-weight: bold; color:#3D3D3D;">PNF</span>.

@list_menu

- @contact_pcdi: Convince the <span style="font-weight: bold; color:#C72F35">PCd'I</span>.
- @contact_psu: Convince the <span style="font-weight: bold; color:#E35A5A">PSU</span>.
- @contact_psri: Convince the <span style="font-weight: bold; color:#FFC0CB;">PSRI</span>.
- @contact_pll: Convince the <span style="font-weight: bold; color:#FFD1D9;">PLL</span>.
- @contact_pri: Convince the <span style="font-weight: bold; color:#3CB371">PRI</span>.
- @contact_ppi: Contact the <span style="font-weight: bold; color:#87CEFA;">PPI</span>.
- @contact_ds: Convince the <span style="font-weight: bold; color:#1E99C5;">PSDI</span>
- @contact_ldr: Convince the <span style="font-weight: bold; color:#FFD700;">PLDI</span>.
- @root: We have done all we can.

@contact_pcdi
view-if: pcdi_formed
choose-if: false
unavailable-subtitle: The <span style="color:#8B0000">Communists</span> would never form a joint list with us.
max-visits: 1

@contact_psu
view-if: psu_formed
choose-if: psu_relation >= 55
unavailable-subtitle: Our relations with the <span style="font-weight: bold; color:#E35A5A">PSU</span> are too poor for this.
on-arrival: anti_fas_psu = 1
go-to: list_menu
max-visits: 1

We are able to negotiate an form a joint list with the <span style="font-weight: bold; color:#E35A5A">PSU</span>! This will aid our efforts in combatting fascism.

@contact_psri
choose-if: not psri_joint_pll and not psri_joint_pri and not psri_joint_pri
unavailable-subtitle: The <span style="font-weight: bold; color:#FFC0CB;">PSRI</span> is already in a joint list with another party.
on-arrival: anti_fas_psri = 1
go-to: list_menu
max-visits: 1

We are able to negotiate an form a joint list with the <span style="font-weight: bold; color:#FFC0CB;">PSRI</span>! This will aid our efforts in combatting fascism.

